## 📊 Server logging and worker model

The runtime passes `app_logging.json` to Uvicorn's native log configuration. The
bounded JSON formatter excludes message text, traceback and locals; unhandled
exceptions retain only their class alongside the correlated HTTP status record.
Use one worker per container, as the generated command enforces. Each process/app
owns an independent Prometheus registry; scale replicas and aggregate scrape
series. An externally overridden multi-worker command does not provide combined
metrics and is outside this deployment profile. Telemetry writes to local stderr;
collector failure does not become a request-path network dependency.
